<div id="u-credit-00127-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crimaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6106971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6106971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606789824" alt="Crimaster" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6106971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crimaster" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6106971); return false;">Crimaster</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588080081 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 13:21</span></p>
